  },
  {
   "x": 8.25,
   "y": 1.55,
   "w": 4.6,
   "h": 0.4736111111111111,
   "text": "Irrotational, incompressible flow reduces to one\nscalar equation:",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12.5,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o048",
   "name": "C3-E13 text 48"
  },
  {
   "x": 8.25,
   "y": 2.2,
   "w": 4.6,
   "h": 0.27875,
   "text": "∇·u = 0  and  u = ∇φ  ⇒  ∇²φ = 0 in Ω(t)",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13.5,
   "color": "#F2B880",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o049",
   "name": "C3-E13 text 49"
  },
  {
   "x": 8.47,
   "y": 3.0,
   "w": 4.38,
   "h": 0.6854166666666667,
   "text": "Laplace has no time derivative: φ at one\ninstant follows from the shape and boundary\ndata at that instant.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12.5,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o050",
   "name": "C3-E13 text 50"
  },
  {
   "x": 8.285,
   "y": 3.062638888888889,
   "w": 0.09,
